WEBVTT

00:00:01.214 --> 00:00:04.365
<v><b>Check-in officer:</b></v> Can you put your case on the scales, please?

00:00:04.389 --> 00:00:05.541
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Shall I help you?

00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:07.565
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> No, I’m fine.

00:00:08.239 --> 00:00:12.557
<v><b>Check-in officer:</b></v> That’s 18 kilos. And your case sir?

00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:20.917
I’m afraid that’s 22.5 kilos. You can only take 20.

00:00:21.186 --> 00:00:23.186
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Dave! What’s in there?

00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:28.464
<v><b>Check-in officer:</b></v> You need to go to the window over there and pay for the extra two and a half kilos.

00:00:28.802 --> 00:00:30.878
 That’ll be £25.

00:00:30.902 --> 00:00:32.676
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> £25?

00:00:32.969 --> 00:00:36.593
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Maybe you can put some of your things in my case.

00:00:37.243 --> 00:00:38.231
Let’s have a look.

00:00:41.445 --> 00:00:42.672
What’s all this?

00:00:43.498 --> 00:00:48.465
Why have you packed walking boots? We’re going to be on the beach!